<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-2448] parquet-avro does not support nested logical-type for avro &lt;= 1.8</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2448</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There was a previous attempt to fix avro logical-type&#160; support in avro in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/projects/PARQUET/issues/PARQUET-2292?filter=allissues.&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/projects/PARQUET/issues/PARQUET-2292?filter=allissues.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The proposed solution is not complete and missed the case of nested logical-types for avro &amp;lt;= 1.8.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Only top level logical-types are currently handled.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
